2026-07-26T10:38:12.6511986Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-26T10:38:12.6572930Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-26T10:38:12.6573597Z i /tmp/Rtmp8Tw0Ds/duckdb
2026-07-26T10:38:12.6574302Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-26T10:38:12.6575037Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-26T10:38:12.6575410Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-26T10:38:12.6576126Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:38:12.6577354Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:38:12.6578021Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-26T10:38:12.6815317Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:38:12.6922922Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:38:12.7331969Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:38:12.7475176Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
